@JobApplication_HostAddress = http://localhost:5113

### Register Recruiter
POST {{JobApplication_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "recruiter@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Recruiter"
}

### Login Recruiter
POST {{JobApplication_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "recruiter@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Create a Job (Authenticated)
POST {{JobApplication_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "title": "Senior .NET Developer",
  "description": "Backend engineer specializing in .NET and EF Core"
}

### Close a Job (Authenticated)
PUT {{JobApplication_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/1/close
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Accept: application/json

### Cancel an Application (via query param)
DELETE {{JobApplication_HostAddress}}/api/applications/1?candidateId=1
Accept: application/json

### Cancel an Application (via X-Candidate-Id header)
DELETE {{JobApplication_HostAddress}}/api/applications/1
X-Candidate-Id: 1
Accept: application/json


